  "description": "In an era where discrimination against male omegas is rampant, high school student Han Je-hyeon develops feelings for teacher Song Soo-hyeon, who is hiding his identity as a beta. After that, even as a college student, Je-hee cannot forget Soo-hyeon and secretly stalks him, eventually encountering him as Soo-hyeon's popularity begins to rise... 'Professor, were you an omega?'\n\n[Original Webtoon](https://www.bomtoon.com/detail/wantalpha)\n\n**Official Translations:**  \nJapanese: [Beltoon](https://www.beltoon.jp/detail/wantalpha), [Lezhin](https://lezhin.jp/comic/wantalpha)",
